     ment 0 is -, sshh is a _l_o_g_i_n _s_h_e_l_l: before reading anything
     else it executes the commands in /eettcc/pprrooffiillee and then, if
     the variable HHOOMMEE names a directory containing a file
     .pprrooffiillee, the commands in $HHOOMMEE/.pprrooffiillee.

     A _c_o_m_m_a_n_d is a sequence of _t_o_k_e_n_s (words) separated by
     blanks or tabs.  The first token names the command to ex-
