               second.

     _c_o_m_m_a_n_d & Run _c_o_m_m_a_n_d in the background, without waiting for
               it; print its process id.  A background command's
               standard input is /ddeevv/nnuullll unless redirected.

     _c_o_m_m_a_n_d && _c_o_m_m_a_n_d
